qn_center_padright\"></td>\n<td rowspan=\"1\" class=\"ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right\"><span class=\"ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right\">(6)</span></td></tr></tbody>\n</table>"
